  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0: Every method now reads the zodiac of the chart instead of subtracting the ayanamsa unconditionally. A chart built with EphCalculationMode.Sidereal already carries sidereal longitudes, and taking the ayanamsa off a second time moved NakshatraOf, PadaOf and above all Dashas by about 24 degrees. The signatures are unchanged and a tropical chart gives the same answers as before. The floor on SharpAstrology.Base moved to 0.14.0, which is the version that lets a chart report its zodiac.",
